# Clash Valor — Privacy Policy

**Last updated: October 26, 2026**

This Privacy Policy explains how Play8 Studio (“we,” “our,” or “us”) handles information in the mobile game Clash Valor.

## 1. Information and Data

Clash Valor may use third-party services that process technical information when you play the game. Depending on the services enabled, this may include device information, IP address, advertising identifiers, app interactions, and diagnostic data.

Game progress and virtual currency may be stored locally on your device.

## 2. Advertising

Clash Valor uses Google AdMob to display advertisements, including rewarded and interstitial ads.

Google and its advertising partners may process information such as advertising identifiers, device information, IP address, approximate location, and ad interactions to serve, measure, and improve advertisements, subject to their applicable policies and settings.

Learn more about Google's advertising practices:
https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads

## 3. How Information Is Used

Information processed by the game and its third-party services may be used to:

- Provide and maintain game functionality.
- Display and measure advertisements.
- Diagnose technical problems and improve performance.
- Prevent fraud and abuse.

We do not sell players' personal information.

## 4. Third-Party Services

Clash Valor may rely on third-party services, including Google AdMob and Google Play services. These services process information under their own privacy policies.

Google Privacy Policy:
https://policies.google.com/privacy

## 5. Data Retention and Deletion

Some game data may remain stored locally on your device. Third-party service providers handle information according to their own retention and deletion policies.

Uninstalling the game may remove locally stored game data.

## 6. Children's Privacy

We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children. If you believe personal information has been provided to us inappropriately, contact us using the details below.

Advertising and audience settings will be configured according to the applicable requirements for the game's intended audience.

## 7. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy when the game or its services change. The latest version will be published at the policy URL.

